{"3604470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kill Your Heart", "steam_appid": 3604470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4947880], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/81d2f885c82ee307584635face07a992.avif?t=1784187632\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cupid Island. Sun, sea, love... and monsters that rejected lovers turn into. People are afraid to confess their feelings — and every day, the number of creatures grows. You are a messenger. Your job: risk your life to deliver love confessions to their intended recipients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/77be700825b55d500d04032182c8f2dd.avif?t=1784187632\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revolver Time Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the chamber, seize the moment, and fire preemptively. Dynamic shootouts where every shot could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/3cf9eeea80f137282f77cf2d0426fba5.poster.avif?t=1784187632\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/3cf9eeea80f137282f77cf2d0426fba5.webm?t=1784187632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/3cf9eeea80f137282f77cf2d0426fba5.mp4?t=1784187632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Survival Horror Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce. Search for keys, manage what little you find, and solve cryptic puzzles to push ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/b28b0d8e52cb43bcf31677632b7b10c6.avif?t=1784187632\" width=800 height=220 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RPG depth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience and grow in strength. New abilities can turn the tide of battle, and the gear you find can mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/4504a7f9afadfcf42785c418f50131af.poster.avif?t=1784187632\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/4504a7f9afadfcf42785c418f50131af.webm?t=1784187632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/4504a7f9afadfcf42785c418f50131af.mp4?t=1784187632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Twisted Tale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a story that’s tragic, absurd, and oddly funny—full of surreal moments that stick.    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thrilling Music</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to an energetic soundtrack that will make your heart skip a beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/1c36562a5676f928d8644d1802680fb1.webp?t=1784187632\" width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/74d924fd4186e66bd817a69adc1ec9aa.poster.avif?t=1784187632\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/74d924fd4186e66bd817a69adc1ec9aa.webm?t=1784187632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/74d924fd4186e66bd817a69adc1ec9aa.mp4?t=1784187632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/81d2f885c82ee307584635face07a992.avif?t=1784187632\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cupid Island. Sun, sea, love... and monsters that rejected lovers turn into. People are afraid to confess their feelings — and every day, the number of creatures grows. You are a messenger. Your job: risk your life to deliver love confessions to their intended recipients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/77be700825b55d500d04032182c8f2dd.avif?t=1784187632\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Revolver Time Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the chamber, seize the moment, and fire preemptively. Dynamic shootouts where every shot could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/3cf9eeea80f137282f77cf2d0426fba5.poster.avif?t=1784187632\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/3cf9eeea80f137282f77cf2d0426fba5.webm?t=1784187632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/3cf9eeea80f137282f77cf2d0426fba5.mp4?t=1784187632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Survival Horror Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce. Search for keys, manage what little you find, and solve cryptic puzzles to push ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/b28b0d8e52cb43bcf31677632b7b10c6.avif?t=1784187632\" width=800 height=220 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RPG depth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience and grow in strength. New abilities can turn the tide of battle, and the gear you find can mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/4504a7f9afadfcf42785c418f50131af.poster.avif?t=1784187632\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/4504a7f9afadfcf42785c418f50131af.webm?t=1784187632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/4504a7f9afadfcf42785c418f50131af.mp4?t=1784187632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Twisted Tale</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a story that’s tragic, absurd, and oddly funny—full of surreal moments that stick.    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thrilling Music</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to an energetic soundtrack that will make your heart skip a beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/1c36562a5676f928d8644d1802680fb1.webp?t=1784187632\" width=800 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/74d924fd4186e66bd817a69adc1ec9aa.poster.avif?t=1784187632\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/74d924fd4186e66bd817a69adc1ec9aa.webm?t=1784187632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/extras/74d924fd4186e66bd817a69adc1ec9aa.mp4?t=1784187632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "In a world where unrequited love turns people into monsters, you are the one who connects human hearts. Fight grotesque creatures, scavenge for resources, and solve cryptic puzzles in this stylish Survival Thriller RPG.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/708089c53c0ae782d0f2a296351b7d2d021ea630/header.jpg?t=1784187632", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/aeaa62db2e8e9c93660e47eb73835c7350c6338d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784187632", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604470/aeaa62db2e8e9c93660e47eb73835c7350c6338d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784187632", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</